{"thread":{"threadID":4160,"boardID":166,"topic":"CS: GO Minigamemaps","time":1486503637,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","lastPostTime":1486504683,"lastPoster":"Schockly","replies":6,"views":324,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":7},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":61480,"threadID":4160,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"CS: GO Minigamemaps","time":1486503637,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":7,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1486504207,"value":1},{"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","time":1486504554,"value":1},{"userID":2418,"username":"Neo","time":1486504574,"value":1},{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1486504608,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1486504958,"value":1},{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1486505161,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1486588043,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Liebe Dream-Community,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>habe gesehen das jetzt einige Maps vorgeschlagen worden sind. Leider sind für mich nicht so wirklich viele dabei wo ich sagen würde die will ich zocken. Jetzt fang ich erstmal mit ein paar Minigamemaps an und werde vielleicht ein anderes mal für andere Server Maps raussuchen. Auf jedenfall sind es mehr Course als wirklich Minigamemaps dabei.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>1. mg_100traps_v4_1<br><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=66a65b-1486494211.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=7afe06-1486495062.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=0860e6-1486495101.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Das Problem bei 100traps ist, dass dort die gleichen Bugs sind wie diese schon in Css waren. Könnte also sein, dass dort nach einer bestimmten Zeit 1 Lvl unmöglich ist, außer ein Admin gibt demjenigen die höchste Gravity.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>2. mg_arcs_multigames_csgo_v2<br><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=118dc6-1486495547.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=6e3385-1486495565.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=f1498c-1486495578.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>3. mg_asdf_csgo<br><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=4d431d-1486495736.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=e92d2f-1486495761.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=6431a4-1486495773.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>4. mg_bob2<br><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=b0effa-1486496013.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=bc39f5-1486496033.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a><a href=\"http://www.bilder-upload.eu/show.php?file=bc39f5-1486496033.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>5. mg_bobii_reborn_v2<br><a h